td>Any<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>(same as human form)<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>2<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>Standard<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>Always lawful evil<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>By character class<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td>\n\n\n<td>+3<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>A wererat in humanoid form tends to be a thin, wiry individual of shorter than average height. The eyes constantly dart around, and the nose and mouth may twitch if he or she is excited. Males often have thin, ragged mustaches.</p><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>In animal form, wererats avoid combat, preferring to use their dire rat shape for skulking and spying. In hybrid form, a wererat fights with a rapier and light crossbow.</p><div topic=\"Alternate Form\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alternate Form (Su):</b> A wererat can assume a bipedal hybrid form or the form of a dire rat.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Curse of Lycanthropy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Curse of Lycanthropy (Su):</b> Any humanoid or giant hit by a wererat\'s bite attack in animal or hybrid form must succeed on a DC 15 Fortitude save or contract lycanthropy.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Disease\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Disease (Ex):</b> Filth fever; bite, Fortitude DC 12, incubation period 1d3 days, damage 1d3 Dex and 1d3 Con. The save DC is Constitution-based.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Rat Empathy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Rat Empathy (Ex):</b> Communicate with rats and dire rats, and +4 racial bonus on Charisma-based checks against rats and dire rats.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> A wererat in rat or hybrid form uses its Dexterity modifier for Climb or Swim checks. It has a +8 racial bonus on Climb checks and can always choose to take 10 on a Climb check, even if rushed or threatened.</p><p>Wererats have a +8 racial bonus on Swim checks from their dire rat form.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Feats\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Feats:</b> Wererats gain Weapon Finesse as a bonus feat.</p><p>The wererat presented here is based on a 1st-level human warrior who is a natural lycanthrope, using the following base ability scores: Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 9, Cha 8.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersK-L');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (473,'Lycanthrope','Weretiger, Human Form',NULL,'Medium','Humanoid','Human, Shapechanger','1d8+1 plus 6d8+18 (50 hp)','+4','20 ft. in breastplate (4 squares); base speed 30 ft.','17 (+2 natural, +5 breastplate), touch 10, flat-footed 17','+5','+6','Glaive +6 melee (1d10+1/x3) or composite longbow (+1 Str bonus) +5 ranged (1d8+1/x3)','Glaive +6 melee (1d10+1/x3) or composite longbow (+1 Str bonus) +5 ranged (1d8+1/x3)','5 ft.','5 ft. (10 ft. with glaive)','-','Alternate form, tiger empathy, low-light vision, scent','Fort +8, Ref +5, Will +4','Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8','Balance +0, Climb +1, Handle Animal +3, Hide +0, Listen +6, Move Silently +0, Spot +6','Alertness, Iron Will','Combat Reflexes, Improved Initiative, Improved Natural Attack (bite, claw)',NULL,'Warm forests','Solitary or pair','5','Standard','Always neutral','By character class','+3','Alternate Form (Su), Curse of Lycanthropy (Su), Improved Grab (Ex), Pounce (Ex), Rake (Ex), Tiger Empathy (Ex)','Human form weretiger; CR 5; Medium humanoid (human, shapechanger); HD 1d8+1 plus 6d8+18; hp 50; Init +4; Spd 20 ft. in breastplate (4 squares); base speed 30 ft.; AC 17 (+2 natural, +5 breastplate), touch 10, flat-footed 17; Base Atk +5; Grp +6; Atk +6 melee (1d10+1/x3, glaive) or +1 Str bonus) +5 ranged (1d8+1/x3, composite longbow (); Full Atk +6 melee (1d10+1/x3, glaive) or +1 Str bonus) +5 ranged (1d8+1/x3, composite longbow (); Space/Reach 5 ft./5 ft. (10 ft. with glaive); SA -; SQ Alternate form, tiger empathy, low-light vision, scent; AL N; SV Fort +8, Ref +5, Will +4; Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8\n\nSkills and Feats: Balance +0, Climb +1, Handle Animal +3, Hide +0, Listen +6, Move Silently +0, Spot +6; Alertness, Combat Reflexes, Improved Initiative, Improved Natural Attack (bite, Iron Will, claw)','\n      <div topic=\"Weretiger\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Weretiger</h3></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><b>Weretiger, Human Form</b><br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Medium Humanoid (Human, Shapechanger)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">1d8+1 plus 6d8+18 (50 hp)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">+4<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">20 ft. in breastplate (4 squares); base speed 30 ft.<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">17 (+2 natural, +5 breastplate), touch 10, flat-footed 17<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">+5/+6<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Glaive +6 melee (1d10+1/x3) or composite longbow (+1 Str bonus) +5 ranged (1d8+1/x3)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"5\">\n<td/>\n<td>Claw +11 melee (1d8+7)<br/></td>\n<td>Claw +11 melee (1d8+7)<br/></td>\n<td/>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Glaive +6 melee (1d10+1/x3) or composite longbow (+1 Str bonus) +5 ranged (1d8+1/x3)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">5 ft./5 ft. (10 ft. with glaive)<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">-<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Alternate form, tiger empathy, low-light vision, scent<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Fort +8, Ref +5, Will +4<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Balance +0, Climb +1, Handle Animal +3, Hide +0, Listen +6, Move Silently +0, Spot +6<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Alertness <sup>B</sup>, Combat Reflexes, Improved Initiative, Improved Natural Attack (bite, claw), Iron Will <sup>B</sup><br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Warm forests<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Solitary or pair<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">5<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Standard<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Always neutral<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">By character class<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">+3<br/></td>\n\n\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>Weretigers in humanoid form tend to be sleekly muscular, taller than average, and very agile.</p><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>Weretigers can assume a hybrid form as well as an animal form. In tiger form, they can pounce and grab just as normal tigers do. In hybrid form, they rely on their deadly claws.</p><div topic=\"Alternate Form\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alternate Form (Su):</b> A weretiger can assume a bipedal hybrid form or the form of a tiger.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Curse of Lycanthropy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Curse of Lycanthropy (Su):</b> Any humanoid or giant hit by a weretiger\'s bite attack in animal or hybrid form must succeed on a DC 15 Fortitude save or contract lycanthropy.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Improved Grab\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Improved Grab (Ex):</b> To use this ability, a weretiger in tiger form must hit with a claw or bite attack. It can then attempt to start a grapple as a free action without provoking an attack of opportunity. If it wins the grapple check, it establishes a hold and can rake.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Pounce\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Pounce (Ex):</b> If a weretiger in tiger form charges an opponent, it can make a full attack, including two rake attacks.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Rake\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Rake (Ex):</b> Attack bonus +9 melee, damage 1d8+3.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Tiger Empathy\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Tiger Empathy (Ex):</b> Communicate with tigers and dire tigers, and +4 racial bonus on Charisma-based checks against tigers and dire tigers.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> In any form, weretigers have a +4 bonus on Balance, Hide, and Move Silently checks. *In areas of tall grass or heavy undergrowth, the Hide bonus improves to +8 in the tiger form.</p><p>The weretiger presented here is a 1st-level human warrior and natural lycanthrope, using the following base ability scores: Str 13, Dex 11, Con 12, Int 10, Wis 9, Cha 8.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersK-L');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (474,'Lycanthrope','Weretiger, Tiger Form',NULL,'Large','Humanoid','Human, Shapechanger','1d8+1 plus 6d8+18 (50 hp)','+6','40 ft. (8 squares)','16 (-1 size, +2 Dex, +5 natural), touch 11, flat-footed 14','+5','+16','','2 claws +11 melee (1d8+7) and bite +6 melee (2d6+3)','10 ft.','5 ft.','Pounce, improved grab, rake, curse of lycanthropy','Alternate form, tiger empathy, damage reduction 10/silver, low-light vision, scent','Fort +10, Ref +7, Will +4','Str 25, Dex 15, Con 16, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8','Balance +6, Climb +12, Handle Animal +3, Hide +2*, Listen +6, Move Silently +12, Spot +6',NULL,'(same as human form)',NULL,'Warm forests','(same as human form)','5','Standard','Always neutral','By character class','+3','Alternate Form (Su), Curse of Lycanthropy (Su), Improved Grab (Ex), Pounce (Ex), Rake (Ex), Tiger Empathy (Ex)','Tiger form weretiger; CR 5; Large humanoid (human, shapechanger); HD 1d8+1 plus 6d8+18; hp 50; Init +6; Spd 40 ft. (8 squares); AC 16 (-1 size, +2 dex, +5 natural), touch 11, flat-footed 14; Base Atk +5; Grp +16; Atk ; Full Atk +11 melee (1d8+7, 2 claws) and +6 melee (2d6+3, bite); Space/Reach 10 ft./5 ft.; SA Pounce, improved grab, rake, curse of lycanthropy; SQ Alternate form, tiger empathy, damage reduction 10/silver, low-light vision, scent; AL N; SV Fort +10, Ref +7, Will +4; Str 25, Dex 15, Con 16, Int 10, Wis 11, Cha 8\n\nSkills and Feats: Balance +6, Climb +12, Handle Animal +3, Hide +2*, Listen +6, Move Silently +12, Spot +6; (same as human form)','\n      <div topic=\"Weretiger\" level=\"3\"><p><h3>Weretiger</h3></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\"><b>Weretiger, Tiger Form</b><br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td/>\n\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">Large Humanoid (Human, Shapechanger)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">1d8+1 plus 6d8+18 (50 hp)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">+6<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td>\n\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\">40 ft. (8 squares)<br/></td>\n\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"5\" curcol=\"3\">\n<td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td>\n